HTML Fast Track Assignments

Assignment 1: Create a Basic Webpage

Create an HTML page that displays:

Your name
Program name
College name
A short introduction about yourself
Your career interest

Use the following tags:

<html>
<head>
<title>
<body>
<h1>
<h2>
<p>
Expected output
My Profile

Name: Ananya
Program: M.E. Cybersecurity
College: Manipal School of Information Sciences

I am interested in web application security and ethical hacking.
