Include:

One main heading
Two subheadings
Three paragraphs
Important words in bold
Technical terms in italics
One highlighted sentence
One horizontal line

Use:

<h1>
<h2>
<p>
<b>
<strong>
<i>
<em>
<mark>
<hr>
<br>
Assignment 3: Lists

Create a webpage that displays:

Cybersecurity Domains
Network Security
Web Application Security
Cloud Security
Digital Forensics
Cryptography
Steps to Create a Strong Password
Use at least 12 characters.
Include uppercase and lowercase letters.
Include numbers.
Include special characters.
Avoid personal information.

