<ul>
<ol>
<li>
Assignment 4: Hyperlinks

Create a webpage containing links to:

OWASP
NIST
CISA
Your college website
Your GitHub profile

Requirements:

Open at least two links in a new tab.
Add descriptive link text.
Do not display only the raw URL.

Use:

<a href="..." target="_blank">

Example:

<a href="https://owasp.org" target="_blank">
    Visit the OWASP Website
</a>
Assignment 5: Add Images

Create a webpage titled “Cybersecurity Awareness”.

Include:

One cybersecurity-related image
Suitable alternative text
Width and height attributes
A short description below the image

Use:

<img src="image.jpg" alt="Cybersecurity awareness" width="400">

Students should understand why the alt attribute is important.

Assignment 6: Create a Table

Create a table showing common cyberattacks.

Attack	Description	Prevention
Phishing	Fake messages used to steal information	Verify sender
Malware	Malicious software	Use antivirus
Password Attack	Attempts to guess passwords	Use strong passwords
DDoS	Overloads a service	Use traffic filtering

Use:

<table>
<tr>
<th>
<td>

Add:

border="1"

for the initial exercise.

